; Probe three cells in a row
;
; ORs the tile flags of the cells at (x+B, y+C), (x+B+3, y+C) and (x+B+6, y+C) into E (E starts at 0); the crouching
; branch of #R$A8A5 uses it for the feet. B is left increased by 6.
; .
; Hardware: none; reads the tile flag map.
;
; HL Position: H = x, L = y (2-pixel units)
; B Offset of the first point in x
; C Offset of the first point in y
; D Column mask (always $1F)
; O:E OR of the tile flags at the points
; O:B B + 6
@label=ProbeRowOf3
c$A97A LD E,$00   ;
 $A97C CALL $A9FE ;
 $A97F INC B      ;
 $A980 INC B      ;
 $A981 INC B      ;
 $A982 CALL $A9FE ;
 $A985 INC B      ;
 $A986 INC B      ;
 $A987 INC B      ;
 $A988 JP $A9FE   ;
